anced, and complex physics topics \n- These experiences are enhanced by an Artificial Intelligence (AI) companion acting as a virtual mentor to answer questions and reinforce learning. \n- Includes 60 topics \n- Suggested for students taking middle school, high school, Advanced Placement (AP), and college-level physics courses \n- Key topic areas include dynamics of uniform circular motion, forces and newton\u2019s laws of motion, simple harmonic motion and elasticity, fluids, rotational dynamics, rotational kinematics, kinematics in one dimension, kinematics in two dimensions, work and energy, transfer of heat, electric forces and electric fields, and impulse and momentum \n- Available as an annual, quarterly, or monthly subscription", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in core physics concepts with interactive VR simulations, guided by an AI-powered STEM companion for deeper learning, engagement, and retention. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.xrguru.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Holo Pundits", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.xrguru.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24358904667036931"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507826282_1071813174532513_4218